<title>USA: Thaxton sees Q4 net loss, 1996 profit.</title>
<headline>Thaxton sees Q4 net loss, 1996 profit.</headline>
<dateline>LANCASTER, S.C. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thaxton Group Inc on Friday said it expected to report a net loss in the fourth quarter of between $0.07 and $0.14 per share.</p>
<p>For the year ended December 31, the company said it expects to post a profit of between $0.16 and $0.23 per share.</p>
<p>In the 1995 fiscal year, the company reported net income of $921,000, or $0.29 per share. Its results for the prior year's fourth quarter were not immediately available.</p>
<p>Thaxton, a financial services company, said it expected to release its results at the end of March.</p>
